SUMMARY:Jamie Hendrickson Trio | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:One of our favorite local guitar heros @jamespaulhendrickson is here Friday night on the @records_in_the_rad dock stage!Of course Tacos and Cold beer on tap all night.Come hang! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n  \nScreenshot\n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jamie-hendrickson-trio-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series-2/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
